OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunshine and showers,
OL,6,Fwith the some of the showers turning
OL,7,Fheavy and thundery in places. Winds
OL,8,Falso turning a little strong once
OL,9,Fagain helping to give a rather cool
OL,10,Ffeel to the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers ease overnight as
OL,13,Fcloud breaks up, leaving clear spells
OL,14,Ffor many. Winds also die down into the
OL,15,Fearly hours. Feeling cool overnight
OL,16,Ffor many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
